# Azran photography style

When generating or replacing any photograph for this site, append the following style block to the end of every image prompt. Do not paraphrase it away.

Photorealistic documentary-style photography, natural daylight, slightly desaturated professional color grade, shallow depth of field, shot on a full-frame camera at f/2.8-f/4, UAE commercial/residential interior setting, clean modern architecture in background, navy-blue workwear/uniform on any technicians shown, no visible text or logos, no exaggerated or stylized rendering — must look like real editorial trade photography, not illustration or CGI.

## Constraints

- Do not generate illustration, CGI, cinematic color, neon, or stock-looking poses.
- Do not render readable text, brand marks, or logos in the frame.
- Technicians wear navy workwear only.
- Prefer UAE interiors: villas, lobbies, kitchens, bathrooms, commercial fit-outs.
- Generate images only when the user asks for photos or named assets.
